    description: "Found by the 2026-10-31 docstring staleness audit (dev 5f6b2af921): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10312026/review and verify). Corpus impact not measured. _get_function_name returns the first symbol child (fennel.py:79-81), also used by _find_enclosing_function (122-125); the grammar has a name field. ((fn [x] (helper) x) v) mints a function x. Related to but distinct from WI-donan. v11."  # f03d
